WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.620
Tracking billable time shouldn't mean reconstructing your day.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:08.240
Your work is scattered across emails, meetings, calls, and texts.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.640
When it's time to bill, you're piecing it all back together.

00:00:11.954 --> 00:00:15.318
J2J Time brings that activity into a daily report

00:00:15.378 --> 00:00:18.058
so you can review your work and decide what to bill.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:19.670
Calls and messages too.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.150
We support Android and iPhone.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.960
Each day, receive a report by email

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.520
with your work activity organized by project.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.960
Review the work behind each entry.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.780
Adjust the project, description, and time.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.500
Approve the entries you're ready to send.

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.380
You decide what gets billed.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.920
We're building a review and approval flow with QuickBooks Time updates,

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:45.780
so the time you approve is the time you record.

00:00:46.204 --> 00:00:47.207
J2J Time

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:49.790
from everyday work to approved time.
